+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-symbols-editor.c — ChopGimp 3.28.1 (lot V6 point 7): the
+ * « Symboles » dockable (path/chopgimp-vsymbols.h)
+ *
+ *    ▣ ▣ ▣ ▣          (thumbnails; tooltip: name, number of occurrences)
+ *    [+] [⇣] [✎] [⛓] [Aa] [🗑]
+ *
+ *  - Nouveau symbole: the selected objects become a symbol and its first
+ *    occurrence;
+ *  - Placer une occurrence (or a double-click): in the center of the
+ *    image, on top of the active vector layer (a new layer if none);
+ *  - Modifier le symbole: enters the selected occurrence (or the first
+ *    one of the selected symbol): its changes go to every occurrence;
+ *  - Rompre le lien, Renommer, Supprimer (occurrences stay as groups).
+ *
